# Shell scripts must stay LF: bash on the SQL Server container (Linux) doesn't
# reliably tolerate CRLF, and forcing CRLF on Windows would just bloat the bytes
# that `docker cp` ships into the container.
*.sh        text eol=lf

# PowerShell 7 (pwsh) handles LF cleanly on both Linux and Windows, and using a
# single line-ending convention across the project keeps diffs and review comments
# focused on real changes.
*.ps1       text eol=lf
